-    /// Incoming messages, as they're stored — see the call site in `AccountStateManagementUtils.swift`'s
-    /// `replayFinalState`. The earliest point there is: the photo never exists in the database as a
-    /// secret one. Reads the toggles straight from Postbox rather than the in-memory mirror, so it's
